{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 17, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark traveler to the Land of the Rising Sun! Prepare thyself for a journey most grand a tapestry woven of ancient lore and modern grace.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Kyoto a City of Splendor**\n\nUpon thy arrival at Kansai International Airport a most wondrous sight behold. Take swift passage to Kyoto a city steeped in history. Lodge thee in a ryokan a dwelling of tatami mats and serene beauty. Then wander through Gion's lantern-lit streets hoping to glimpse a geiko a vision of elegance. Dine upon exquisite kaiseki a feast of many courses a true delight for the palate.\n\n**Day Two: Temples and Gardens a Realm of Tranquility**\n\nVisit Kiyomizu-dera Temple a wooden stage jutting forth towards the heavens. Explore Fushimi Inari Shrine a path of thousands of vermillion torii gates a sight to behold. Lose thyself in the Ryoan-ji Temple's Zen garden a space for contemplation and peace. In the evening partake of a traditional tea ceremony a ritual of grace and refinement.\n\n**Day Three: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nA journey forth to Nara a city famed for its friendly deer. Stroll through Nara Park where these gentle creatures roam freely. Marvel at Todai-ji Temple housing a colossal bronze Buddha a testament to faith.  Then return to Kyoto for a final evening of exploration.\n\n**Day Four:  Osaka's Culinary Delights and Dotonbori's Gleam**\n\nHie thee to Osaka a city known for its vibrant energy and delectable cuisine.  Explore Osaka Castle a symbol of the city's power.  Then lose thyself in Dotonbori a dazzling district of neon lights and street food.  Indulge in takoyaki and okonomiyaki two Osaka specialties a culinary adventure.\n\n**Day Five:  Hiroshima's Remembrance and Miyajima's Shrine**\n\nA somber pilgrimage to Hiroshima a city scarred by tragedy yet resilient in spirit. Visit the Peace Memorial Park and Museum a poignant reminder of the past. Then journey to Miyajima Island home to Itsukushima Shrine a floating torii gate a breathtaking spectacle.\n\n**Day Six:  Kyoto's Golden Pavilion and Departure**\n\nVisit Kinkaku-ji the Golden Pavilion a shimmering temple reflecting in a tranquil pond.  Explore Nishiki Market a bustling marketplace overflowing with local delicacies.  Then depart from Kansai International Airport carrying with thee memories of a journey most glorious.\n\nFarewell traveler may thy days be filled with wonder and thy heart with joy. Go forth and embrace the beauty of Japan!\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0021908108610659838}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3947389561508317e-05}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -1.0071897506713867}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.007763806264847517}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.9573058485984802}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -0.40598630905151367}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -1.9073468138230965e-06}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.001956336200237274}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -8.010543388081715e-05}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.4877487123012543}, {"token": "▁Prepare", "logprob": -2.0579419136047363}, {"token": "▁thys", "logprob": -0.233876571059227}, {"token": "elf", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.000179036331246607}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.0022633669432252645}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.14264614880084991}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.02162485010921955}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.23962391912937164}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.35177117586135864}, {"token": "▁tapestry", "logprob": -0.7673801779747009}, {"token": "▁woven", "logprob": -1.600469946861267}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.07003537565469742}, {"token": "▁ancient", "logprob": -0.015445027500391006}, {"token": "▁lore", "logprob": -0.03663898631930351}, {"token": "▁and", "logprob": -4.2437604861333966e-05}, {"token": "▁modern", "logprob": -0.00571865681558847